1
00:00:00,318 --> 00:00:03,528
Wha?... The entire weekend?
You mean I wouldn't see you at all?

2
00:00:03,696 --> 00:00:08,196
But I do... No, no,
l knew what I was getting into.

3
00:00:09,035 --> 00:00:11,375
(Penny:)You can't put a saddle
on Leonard Hofstadter.

4
00:00:13,373 --> 00:00:18,503
(Penny:)Oh, my, is it getting hot in here? Ay, Papi.

5
00:00:19,212 --> 00:00:21,632
"Ay, Papi"?

6
00:00:21,798 --> 00:00:23,968
(Leonard:)- What is that?
- An acting choice.

7
00:00:24,133 --> 00:00:25,173
(Stuart:)Hmm.

8
00:00:25,343 --> 00:00:27,553
(Leonard:)So you chose that
when you become turned on...

9
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:30,470
...you'd turn into Speedy Gonzalez.

10
00:00:31,849 --> 00:00:33,849
Do you got a problem with that, Papi?

11
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:36,560
(Leonard:)Uh-uh.

12
00:00:37,939 --> 00:00:40,399
Penny? Penny? Penny?

13
00:00:40,566 --> 00:00:44,566
(Penny:)Sorry, Stallion.
Your weird friend Giraffe is here.

14
00:00:46,239 --> 00:00:50,369
(Sheldon:)Hello, Penny. I just stopped by
to bring you this gift.

15
00:00:50,535 --> 00:00:51,955
Gummi Bears? Thank you.

16
00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:53,750
(Sheldon:)Now that you're in my debt...

17
00:00:55,123 --> 00:00:58,463
(Sheldon:)...please manipulate Amy into
releasing me from my commitment...

